  postHeader: 
  postContent: "Over the past five years, Ghana\u2019s nationwide malaria incidence
    has dropped by 60%, thanks to bed-net distribution, new indoor spraying programs,
    and community education\u2014though many outlets have yet to report these successes.\n"
  funFact_Hint: "Think about what facts have been missing from other reports you\u2019ve
    seen."
