    <Explanation>k__BackingField: 'It highlights achievements that most media have
      left out. '
    <Choice>k__BackingField: 4
  - <IsCorrectAnswer>k__BackingField: 0
    <Explanation>k__BackingField: Framing slants facts; this is about filling in
